---
/**
 * Build-time fallback for PR #1 (Scaffold).
 *
 * The proper 302 redirect to /ca/ lives in src/pages/index.astro and
 * ships with PR #3 (components + pages). Until then, this minimal
 * page keeps `npm run build` green and gives the site an entry point
 * so the static output is not a 404.
 *
 * The meta refresh keeps the page static (zero client JS) and lands
 * a visitor who hits / on the default locale once `/ca/index.astro`
 * exists in PR #3.
 */
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ca">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Festès de Gata 2026</title>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/festes-gata/ca/" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/festes-gata/ca/" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      Festès de Gata 2026 — en construcció. Sigueu a
      <a href="/festes-gata/ca/">/ca/</a>.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
